# Backend conventions

- One module = one schema + one DbContext. Never query another module’s tables.
- Cross-module calls go through `Healingram.Contracts` interfaces.
- Business rules live in the module, not in the gateway.
- Unit-test domain/status/price/publication rules before completing a story.
- Log structured events with `CorrelationId`. Never log phone, email, notes, or wellness free text.
- Idempotency keys on request create, alternative accept, payment intent, webhook, notification.
- `PAID` only from a verified webhook handler.
